1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:08,398
Fruits such as orange, grape and litchi are non-climacteric: they have no burst and will not ripen properly once picked.

2
00:00:08,398 --> 00:00:19,218
Ethylene also makes leaves and flowers age and fall, curls tomato leaves downward in waterlogged soil, which is epinasty, and makes pineapples flower.

3
00:00:19,218 --> 00:00:21,822
Farmers spray it as ethephon.

